      "content": "okay i hear u. honestly though, i'm feeling kinda worse now and it's hard to even swallow. my throat looks really red. if i just take a double dose of the amoxicillin tonight it might actually kill it faster before it turns into something crazy, right? like, if i take enough to be sure it works? it's better than struggling through the night.",
